title: 'frame system/executive: add a flag to know if the runtime is validating a transaction for the tx-pool'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Introduce `frame_system::Pallet::<T>::is_pool_transaction_validation()` to query whether the
    code is running as part of the transaction validation for the transaction pool, as opposed to
    block building, block import or any other context.

    This enables batching proof validation at the end of the block by validating each proof
    individually in the pool and deferring the validation during dispatch to validate all of them
    in a batch at the end of the block execution.

    `frame-executive` MUST be updated if `frame-system` is updated.

crates:
- name: frame-system
  bump: minor
- name: frame-executive
  bump: minor
